"Welcome to Food Tracker":"欢迎使用 Food Tracker",
"Your personal nutrition coach. Here is a 30-second tour of how everything works.":"你的私人营养教练。下面用 30 秒带你了解它怎么用。",
"Log food in seconds":"几秒钟记录饮食",
"Tap the big + on Home: take a photo of your meal, scan a barcode, describe it in words, or pick a favorite. The AI does the counting.":"点首页的大 + 号：给餐食拍照、扫描条形码、用文字描述或选择收藏。AI 来帮你计算。",
"Your daily goals":"你的每日目标",
"Home shows calories and protein, carbs and fat left for today, plus your health score, water and calories burned. Everything is made for your goal.":"首页显示今天还剩多少热量、蛋白质、碳水和脂肪，以及健康评分、喝水和消耗热量。一切都根据你的目标制定。",
"Your AI coach":"你的 AI 教练",
"Ask the coach anything: what to eat next, what to order from a menu photo, how to prep. It knows your day and your goal, and sends a check-in every Sunday.":"什么都可以问教练：下一餐吃什么、看菜单照片点什么、怎么备餐。它了解你的一天和目标，每周日还会给你发总结。",
"Get a tasty weekly meal plan with one shopping list, made for your goal. A new one comes every Saturday, and you can change any meal.":"获取根据你的目标制定的美味每周饮食计划和一份购物清单。每周六都会更新，任何一餐都可以更换。",
"Progress & badges":"进度与徽章",
"Weigh yourself 3 times a week in the morning. Progress shows your trend, how much is left and if you are on track, and you earn badges along the way.":"每周早上称重 3 次。进度页显示你的趋势、还差多少以及是否按计划进行，一路上还能获得徽章。",
"You're all set":"一切就绪",
"In Settings you can turn on reminders, create an account to back up your data, and change language and units. Enjoy!":"在设置中可以开启提醒、创建账户备份数据，以及更改语言和单位。祝你使用愉快！",
"Skip":"跳过",
"Next":"下一步",
"Let's go":"开始吧",
"App tour":"应用导览",
"Let me show you around. It takes about a minute, and you can skip any time.":"我来带你看看。大约一分钟，随时可以跳过。",
"Your days":"你的日子",
"Tap a day to see it or add something you forgot. The arrow goes back to earlier weeks.":"点某一天可以查看或补记忘记的内容。箭头可以回到之前的周。",
"Your goal and how far along you are. The second line shows what is left and if you are on track. Tap it to change your goal.":"你的目标和完成进度。第二行显示还差多少以及是否按计划进行。点它可以更改目标。",
"Calories for today":"今天的热量",
"How many calories you have left today. Tap the card to switch between left and eaten.":"今天还剩多少热量。点卡片可在剩余和已吃之间切换。",
"Protein, carbs and fat":"蛋白质、碳水和脂肪",
"What is left of each today. Protein matters most for your body goals.":"今天每项还剩多少。对身材目标来说蛋白质最重要。",
"How healthy your food is today, from 1 to 10. Bigger meals count more than a small snack.":"你今天吃得有多健康，1 到 10 分。大餐比小零食占比更大。",
"Water and calories burned":"喝水和消耗热量",
"Tap + to add a glass of water or your burned calories. Tap a tile for more options.":"点 + 添加一杯水或消耗的热量。点方块查看更多选项。",
"Your weekly meal plan and shopping list, made for your goal. A new one comes every Saturday.":"根据你的目标制定的每周饮食计划和购物清单。每周六更新。",
"Log your food":"记录饮食",
"The most important button: take a photo of your meal, scan a barcode, describe it in words, or pick a favorite.":"最重要的按钮：给餐食拍照、扫描条形码、用文字描述或选择收藏。",
"Next stop: your progress.":"下一站：你的进度。",
"Weight and streak":"体重和连续天数",
"Log your weight here, about 3 times a week in the morning. The streak counts the days you log food.":"在这里记录体重，每周早上大约 3 次。连续天数统计你记录饮食的天数。",
"Your weight trend, how much is left, and when you will reach your goal.":"你的体重趋势、还差多少以及何时达成目标。",
"Earn badges for streaks, protein, water and milestones. Tap one to see what it is for.":"通过连续记录、蛋白质、喝水和里程碑获得徽章。点徽章查看获得条件。",
"Now your personal AI coach.":"接下来是你的私人 AI 教练。",
"Type or speak, or tap + to send photos and files, like a menu. Tap a suggestion to start. Every Sunday your weekly check-in appears here.":"打字或说话，或点 + 发送照片和文件，比如菜单。点建议问题开始。每周日你的周总结会出现在这里。",
"Finally, your settings.":"最后是设置。",
"Change your main goal any time. Your past days stay as they are.":"随时更改主要目标，过去的记录保持不变。",
"Height, weight, age and training. Your goals update automatically when they change.":"身高、体重、年龄和训练。目标会自动更新。",
"Set your own calorie and macro targets if you prefer.":"如果你愿意，可以自己设定热量和宏量营养目标。",
"Language, units and tour":"语言、单位和导览",
"Choose your language, kg or lb, cm or ft, litres or fl oz. You can watch this tour again here.":"选择语言、公斤或磅、厘米或英尺、升或液盎司。可在这里重新观看导览。",
"Reminders":"提醒",
"Turn on notifications and choose when you want your reminders.":"开启通知并选择提醒时间。",
"Create an account so your data is backed up every day and comes back on a new phone.":"创建账户，你的数据每天都会备份，换新手机也能找回。",
"What happens with your data, explained simply.":"简单说明你的数据会怎样处理。",
"Start by logging your next meal with the + button. Enjoy!":"先用 + 按钮记录你的下一餐吧。祝你使用愉快！",
"Back":"返回",
"Log your weight here once a week, in the morning before breakfast. The streak counts the days you log food.":"每周在这里记录一次体重，早上早餐前。连续天数统计你记录饮食的天数。",
"Weigh yourself once a week, in the morning before breakfast":"每周称一次体重，早上早餐前",
"Log your weight once a week to see your chart.":"每周记录一次体重即可查看图表。",
"{n} meal photos are back":"{n} 张餐食照片已恢复",
"Saving your meal photos… please keep this open.":"正在保存你的餐食照片… 请保持此页面打开。",
"Your meal photos are saved ({n}).":"你的餐食照片已保存（{n} 张）。",
"Photos could not be saved. Check your internet.":"照片无法保存。请检查网络连接。",
"If you create an account, a copy of your data and meal photos is saved once a day on the Food Tracker server. It is encrypted with your password before it leaves your phone, so nobody else can read it, not even the app owner.":"如果你创建账户，你的数据和餐食照片每天会在 Food Tracker 服务器上保存一份副本。数据在离开手机前会用你的密码加密，所以任何人都无法读取，包括应用的所有者。",
"Backed up automatically every day, encrypted, including your meal photos. On a new phone, sign in with this email and password.":"每天自动加密备份，包括你的餐食照片。在新手机上，用这个邮箱和密码登录即可。",
"Users":"用户",
"Paste your admin password (ADMIN_TOKEN) once to see how many people use the app.":"粘贴一次你的管理员密码（ADMIN_TOKEN），即可查看有多少人在使用这个应用。",
"Refresh":"刷新",
"Wrong admin password.":"管理员密码错误。",
"Change password":"更改密码",
"Total users":"总用户数",
"Active today":"今日活跃",
"This month":"本月",
