"With account":"有账户",
"Active per day (last 14 days)":"每日活跃（最近 14 天）",
"🔔 {n} phones with reminders on.":"🔔 {n} 部手机开启了提醒。",
"No connection":"无法连接",
"Usage count":"用户统计",
