"Enough energy for you and your baby, no dieting":"为你和宝宝提供足够能量，不节食",
"Pregnant, months 1–3":"怀孕第 1–3 个月",
"Pregnant, months 4–6":"怀孕第 4–6 个月",
"Pregnant, months 7–9":"怀孕第 7–9 个月",
"Breastfeeding":"哺乳期",
"Train with weights so the weight you lose is fat, not muscle.":"进行力量训练，让减掉的是脂肪而不是肌肉。",
"How do I lose fat and build muscle at the same time?":"如何同时减脂和增肌？",
"What should I eat before and after training?":"训练前后应该吃什么？",
"What should I eat and avoid right now?":"现在应该吃什么、避免什么？",
"Gaining weight during pregnancy is normal and healthy. Your doctor or midwife can tell you what is right for you.":"孕期体重增加是正常且健康的。你的医生或助产士可以告诉你适合你的情况。",
"Eat enough carbs around long or hard training":"长时间或高强度训练前后要吃足够的碳水",
"Ask your doctor or midwife how much weight gain is right for you":"问问医生或助产士增重多少适合你",
"No alcohol, raw fish, raw meat or unpasteurised cheese":"不喝酒，不吃生鱼、生肉或未经巴氏杀菌的奶酪",
"Lose some weight slowly while you build muscle, or keep your weight the same.":"一边增肌一边慢慢减一点体重，或保持体重不变。",
"Slowly, so you can still build muscle":"慢慢来，这样仍能增肌",
"Where are you right now?":"你现在处于哪个阶段？",
"Your calories go up a little as your baby grows. Please also follow the advice of your doctor or midwife.":"随着宝宝长大，你的热量会稍微增加。也请遵循医生或助产士的建议。",
"Burned · {n} active":"消耗 · 活动 {n}",
"Connect your Apple Watch (through Apple Health), WHOOP or another tracker once. Your burned calories are then filled in automatically every time you open the app.":"只需连接一次 Apple Watch（通过“健康”App）、WHOOP 或其他手环。之后每次打开 App，消耗的卡路里都会自动填入。",
"Your daily targets. Tap a number to change it, or use − and +.":"你的每日目标。点按数字即可修改，或使用 − 和 +。",
"Macros add up to {n} kcal.":"三大营养素合计 {n} kcal。",
"That is {d} kcal away from your calorie goal.":"与你的热量目标相差 {d} kcal。",
"A small privacy update":"一个小的隐私更新",
"Accounts":"账户",
"Copy all emails":"复制所有邮箱",
"Could not copy":"无法复制",
"Last active {d}":"最近活跃 {d}",
"No ads, no tracking and no selling of data. No emails are sent to you.":"没有广告、没有跟踪、不出售数据。我们不会给你发邮件。",
"OK":"好",
"Search":"搜索",
"Show accounts":"查看账户",
"Since {d}":"自 {d} 起",
"So the app owner can help you if you ever forget your login, your account email is now visible to them. Your meals, photos and everything else stay encrypted: only you can read them.":"为了在你忘记登录信息时 App 所有者能帮助你，你的账户邮箱现在对其可见。你的饮食记录、照片和其他所有内容仍然加密：只有你能读取。",
"The app owner can see the email address of each account, for example to help if you forget your login. Your meals, photos and everything else stay encrypted.":"App 所有者可以看到每个账户的邮箱地址，例如在你忘记登录信息时提供帮助。你的饮食记录、照片和其他所有内容仍然加密。",
"The app owner can see your account email, but never your data.":"App 所有者可以看到你的账户邮箱，但永远看不到你的数据。",
